__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.env
config/*.env
configs/*.env
!configs/*.env.example
artifacts/*/environment-unredacted.txt
vendor/
.venv/

# Benchmark evidence under results/ is the whole point of this repo -- a summary
# whose raw logs were gitignored is exactly the "stale pointer" failure in
# docs/POSTMORTEM-2026-08-25.md. Keep raw run logs even though *.log is ignored.
!results/**/*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
